OL,4,BOutdated or still relevant in 2026?    
OL,5,GAfter 60 years, is time finally        
OL,6,Grunning out on the 3pm blackout in     
OL,7,Gfootball?                              
OL,9,FWith pretty much every available       
OL,10,Ftelevision slot now exhausted, next    
OL,11,Fyear the Premier League and the EFL    
OL,12,Fare set to hold serious discussions    
OL,13,Fabout its future.                      
OL,15,FThere are concerns, especially within  
OL,16,Fnon-league football, that removing the 
OL,17,Fblackout could have detrimental        
OL,18,Feffects on attendances and finances.   
